Z||000003||GTDude||12-15-2001||09:55 PM||||Thanks dude......but I still prefer the GM gasket cause it has a silicone bead made on the gasket.  Most likely someone had...at one time overtightened the pan...sinking in the pan at the bolt holes making the thick gasket necessary.  Always check the bolt holes on pan gaskets when doing a trans service.<P>Thanks for the info tho...I know what I can use if all else fails!<P>Phil Pettus<P>------------------<BR>GTDude's 86GT||||reg||3
